{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:243f88645fb81a36","name":"Lhosan Industries","source":{"id":"source:reference-243f88645fb81a36","title":"Lhosan Industries","revision":19223,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:33:14Z","sha256":"a94d5c0043d97113d248d55ddd310ecfa09a56b0e9b0fb0797eed3d961597804","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19223","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lhosan%20Industries&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-243f88645fb81a36","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lhosan Industries is widely regarded as the inventor and first mass producer of the modern ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swoop Racer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Daggerstar_Swoop_Racer","referenceId":"reference:a34c5bac9e33b59c"},". Because their first factory is located in the Lower City of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},", the planet becomes a center of swoop-racing popularity. Lhosan's plan to diversify to other worlds is disrupted by the Mandalorian occupation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In a move that demonstrates the power and influence of the company, chairman ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jervo Thalien"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jervo_Thalien?action=edit&redlink=1"}," works with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Haydel Goravvus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Haydel_Goravvus","referenceId":"reference:23a70e4a0b9d95ab"}," to orchestrate the acceptance of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"}," into ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," to protect the planet and its supporting resource systems in the region. The plan succeeds. However, once it becomes apparent that the Mandalorian invasion is going to reach ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},", Thalien wastes no time in pulling operations offworld. The resulting scandal threatens to devastate the company and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jervo Thalien"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jervo_Thalien?action=edit&redlink=1"}," personally, if it comes to light. Thalien works to make sure that never happens, but ultimately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Haydel Goravvus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Haydel_Goravvus","referenceId":"reference:23a70e4a0b9d95ab"}," thwarts him, enabling the company to become a strong supporter of the war and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lhosan Industries produces dozens of models of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swoop Racers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swoop_Racers"}," of virtually any size and configuration a customer could request. Although purchasers customize the stock units, creating a vibrant aftermarket culture, Lhosan takes pride in providing a first-class product adored by fans throughout the galaxy. Their quick move from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"}," slows and hampers their production in the following months, but the Mandalorian onslaught itself reduces the immediate demand in any case.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Lhosan Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Haydel Goravvus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Haydel_Goravvus","referenceId":"reference:23a70e4a0b9d95ab"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
